sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Wayline poller
  participant P as Provider
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  W->>D: Read checkpoint
  W->>P: GET events after checkpoint
  alt valid ordered batch
    W->>D: Lock checkpoint and compare
    W->>D: Append dispositions and update flight projections
    W->>D: Reassess affected trips and persist notifications
    W->>D: Commit new checkpoint with results
  else unavailable or invalid response
    W->>D: Record provider failure and keep checkpoint
  end
